---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-50 py-10 dark:border-zinc-800/80 dark:bg-zinc-950">
	<div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-6 px-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-6">
		<div>
			<p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">조동이형</p>
			<p class="mt-1 max-w-md text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
				게임으로 인생을 깨닫고 싶은 조동이의 온갖 삽질과 사유의 기록소.
			</p>
		</div>
		<p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-500">© {year} 조동이형. All rights reserved.</p>
	</div>
</footer>
